<title>CANADA: C-MAC buys Belgium's Electromag N.V..</title>
<headline>C-MAC buys Belgium's Electromag N.V..</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>C-MAC Industries Inc said on Monday that it acquired Electromag N.V., of Belgium.</p>
<p>C-MAC did not disclose the value of the transaction.</p>
<p>Electromag operates a plant in Ronse, Belgium and specializes in the design and manufacture of thick film hybrid circuits for the automotive and telecommunication sectors.</p>
<p>Electromag had 1996 sales of about C$20 million, C-MAC said. The new plant will be part of the Sherbrooke, Quebec-based company's microcircuits division, which operates plants in Canada, the United States, England and France.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
